## 5. Non-Functional Requirements (NFRs)

| Dimension | Target Benchmark | Verification Mechanism |
|---|---|---|
| **Performance** | Web LCP ≤ 2.5s, API response p95 ≤ 150ms | Lighthouse audit, API load tests |
| **Security** | OWASP Top 10 compliance, CSRF/CORS headers, timingSafeEqual auth | Security review, lint gates |
| **Reliability** | Zero-downtime deploys, automated retry queues, graceful offline fallback | E2E integration tests |
| **Accessibility** | WCAG 2.2 AA contrast (>4.5:1 text), full keyboard navigability | `design-review` gate |
| **Observability** | Structured JSON logging, error monitoring via Sentry | Health probes, log telemetry |

